---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Now — Bishwas Adhikari"
  description="What I'm learning and building right now."
>
  <div class="now prose" data-pagefind-body>
    <h1>Now</h1>
    <p class="meta">Updated Aug 2026</p>
    <p>
      Right now I'm building this site itself — in the open, with the help of AI
      tooling that I review line by line. The first tutorials are landing; Git
      basics came first because it's the tool everything else stands on.
    </p>
    <p>
      This page changes as my focus does. If it looks stale, the archive is the
      truer record.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .now h1 {
    font-size: var(--step-3);
  }

  .now .meta {
    margin: var(--space-2) 0 var(--space-4);
  }
</style>
